## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Favor Tempo (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has low chain crowd control and Rafaela's first-rotation tempo matters more than Fortitude.; Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when sustain fighters, shield supports, or attack-speed carries are forcing extended front-to-back fights.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when one magic burst combo can delete Rafaela before the second Holy Healing cycle.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use when a predictable dive combo reaches Rafaela before Flicker or Holy Baptism can create peel.
- Total cost: 10650 gold

Default ranked roam setup built around Favor, mana uptime, Flask saves, ultimate resets, and enough self-survival to stay near the carry line.

### Roam Anti-Sustain Aura (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice, Radiant Armor, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Purify
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when repeated physical contact is the main threat and the enemy lacks reliable lockdown.; Antique Cuirass over Radiant Armor when Use when physical skill burst from assassins or fighters is killing Rafaela before she can cast the second heal.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against single-cycle magic burst rather than repeated magic poke or burn.; Oracle over Radiant Armor when Use when Rafaela is surviving the first hit and needs more cooldown plus received healing to keep casting.
- Total cost: 10630 gold

Defensive sustain-mirror setup for games where Rafaela must live in Dominance Ice range and Purify prevents the first crowd-control chain from ending the fight.

### Roam Sprint Chase Control (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Flask of the Oasis, Ice Queen Wand, Fleeting Time, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Flask of the Oasis, Ice Queen Wand
