- Battle spell: Sprint
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when crowd control or magic poke means Rafaela needs Fortitude more than the extra 15 Movement Speed.; Glowing Wand over Ice Queen Wand when Use when Rafaela can safely tag healers or shielders from range and the team needs Lifebane outside Dominance Ice range.; Oracle over Fleeting Time when Use when the fight is not about ultimate resets and Rafaela needs more durability for repeated Holy Healing casts.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use when one assassin combo can be stalled long enough for allies to collapse on the overcommit.
- Total cost: 10880 gold

Greedier rotation setup for low-lockdown drafts where Sprint, Rapid Boots, and Ice Queen Wand let Rafaela reveal, slow, and keep allies moving through chase fights.

